  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting country diagnostics for climate resilient health systems in LMICs and FCAS.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This fund will provide support to the World Bank Health Systems Transformation and Resilience Fund: Climate and Health Initiative. It is a contribution  to support countries deliver on their climate and health commitments and to leverage the necessary finance. 
This project will also complement support to countries via other components of this programme. It will deliver similar diagnostic, technical assistance and capacity building support via Climate, Health and Vulnerability Assessments. Working through multilateral channels offers economies of scale and means we can focus on development of sound investment cases and project pipelines to underpin implementation.</narrative>
  </description>
